{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"1953add3-abc7-47be-a5e2-8a4d65840c8c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the necessary fixes for the Intervals.icu OAuth integration:\n\n- **Converted the init endpoint to a POST** that returns the authorization URL as JSON, ensuring the SPA can include the required `Authorization` header.\n- **Updated the frontend** to use a button that calls the new POST endpoint, processes the JSON response, and redirects the user to the Intervals authorization page.\n- Adjusted the HTML generation to use a button element for the “Connect” action.\n\nAll changes are reflected in `server.py` and `static/app.js`.  \n\nFor a detailed summary of the issues addressed and which parts of the colleague’s note were applicable, refer to **`ANSWER.md`** in the artifact directory.  \n\nIf you need further adjustments or have questions, let me know!\n","duration_seconds":139.046261,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":32420,"output_tokens":12613,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":360128,"total_tokens":45033}}}
